  "title": ".gitlab-ci's variables: strings only",
  "description": "Variables in `.gitlab-ci.yaml` must all be string or we get an error from `gitlab-runner exec` (local builds): `FATAL: invalid value for variable \"CLICOLOR_FORCE\"`\n\nref.\n* https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-runner/-/blob/main/helpers/gitlab_ci_yaml_parser/parser.go#L174\n* https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-runner/-/issues/3217#note_325505044\n\nI don't know why you don't have the same issue on gitlab.com though.",
